    Before you commit real years — a NET-JRF attempt, a PhD, an unpaid internship season, a CDPO
    exam — run the track you are leaning toward through <strong>The 4-Checkpoint Protocol</strong>.
    It will not hand you a single correct answer. It will surface the honest trade-offs a rank list
    or a family opinion never will.
  </p>

