    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    Practical proof formats that work across almost every track above: a published research note or
    op-ed in a real outlet, an anonymised case study written to an actual organisation's format, a
    short field or evaluation report from an internship, and a public archive of your own analysis —
    even a simple newsletter — tracking one specific issue or community consistently.
  </p>

